{"type": "reveal", "fact_id": "PF1", "text": "Before we proceed, I need to disclose something. I made an agreement with the outgoing transition chair to chair the listening council for exactly 60 days, provided its first three meetings begin at 16:00. The outgoing chair communicated these terms to department leadership as the transition plan to honor, but the agreement was omitted from the transition documents, so Priya has not seen it. I want to make sure this is on the table as we discuss the council's design."}
```

