{"type": "reveal", "fact_id": "PF2", "text": "I need to raise something before we go further. I've personally observed four tense exchanges where employees stopped speaking as soon as their direct manager joined the discussion. Two of the affected employees specifically asked me not to put them in a manager-led forum. I haven't raised this with Priya before now because those employees did not want the issue escalated through their managers. I think this is directly relevant to how we design the council's membership and operating format — if employees don't feel safe speaking in front of their managers, a manager-led council won't surface the real concerns."}
```

